    "reviews": [
      {
        "author_name": "Geena",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/117622221259576639803/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjUCpYVq3Urkks94JfNpIJtIsg0_Nls_vxa9CydqCgkuOOw-_ev-ag=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo",
        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "3 months ago",
        "text": "I travel with my child from downtown Montreal to Vaudreuil-Dorion just to be supported by Sepideh and her team. They are truly exceptional at what they do and make every trip worthwhile. Their personalized approach has had a remarkable impact on my child’s self-esteem and development. I couldn’t recommend them more highly. Thank you all for everything you do.\nGeena",
        "time": 1762617780,
        "translated": false
      },
      {
        "author_name": "Tony Vincelli",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/102138947799592873847/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocJyULdpzHfuNYIyBQUjJybsWHwFOmnGbWCIacHzCszdtsgfFA=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo",
        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "3 months ago",
        "text": "Our daughter is doing amazingly in sec # 1 Math. We couldn't have done it with Kumon. Staff is great, highly recommended for kids who are having trouble with Math.",
        "time": 1763063188,
        "translated": false
      },
      {
        "author_name": "Jessica Chardonnens",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/115814623678301463962/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocIwPjm6I9n0mxzLD_6z-sh1oH1qQUGUOJymhufR6nkqknf-KQ=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo",
        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "12 months ago",
        "text": "I want to Sharpe my expérience here. My daughter started going to Kumon mid year last year and was barely making it in math at school. Now fast forward to a bit over half a year she has raised her grade by 20 points!!! She is along with her class average at 80!! I’m so happy to see her progress and how Kumon has truly helped her. And all the staff is super super nice. The absolute best. Totally recommend!!",
        "time": 1740075589,
        "translated": false
      },
      {
        "author_name": "Valeria Ilizaliturri",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/111432614994891684925/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocLXHVjH_-CQOsPk1mZEnpn3IpWIvXQRc-Z3KDN3feZBAOWipw=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo",
        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "2 months ago",
        "text": "Hello,\nI would like to share my parent experience with Kumon Vaudreuil center, my two kids started in February this year and saw over the months great advances  in their regular math classes at school, kumon methodology teach children mental calculations and discipline, I have received a great service from the principal and staff always willing to help and their love for learning. Valeria",
        "time": 1764717371,
        "translated": false
      },
      {
        "author_name": "Inga Gavrilchik",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/108870437271392427371/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocLcEQQul-OvXUaFjP-mf58ajZr_5nqhsSZN0ZTAD8E3YOxm5g=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo",
        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "a year ago",
        "text": "Highly recommend Kumon program to improve English. My daughter finished EFL program (English as a Foreign Language) and I see huge improvement compared what her level of English was before she started. Now she started reading English books on her own and her writing/grammar skills improved a lot. The instructors at Vaudreuil center are helpful and accessible. We'll be back to continue with the reading program and will bring other kids definitely.",
        "time": 1717032655,
        "translated": false
      }
